  "releaseNotes": "## [2.5.3.2] - 2026-11-20\n\n### Added\n\n- Support for case insensitive compare with the equality operators.\n- Support for radix and format in string/int conversions.\n\n### Fixed\n- An issue where properties with conditionals would eagerly validate both branches. \n  This could cause some properties to fail in unexpected ways if used with devices that do not support them.\n- Some devices reported string property values with an incorrect length, causing property reads to fail.\n\n### Changed \n\n- The module is now licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.",
